# Lines starting with '#' (outside a body) are comments.
// Double-slash comments work too.
// A request that appears before any ### separator is also picked up:
GET https://httpbin.org/get

### Simple GET with a name
GET https://httpbin.org/uuid

### GET with query parameters
GET https://httpbin.org/get?framework=tide-commander&mode=sample&page=1
Accept: application/json

### GET with an explicit HTTP version token (ignored by the runner)
GET https://httpbin.org/user-agent HTTP/1.1
User-Agent: TideCommander-HTTP-Sample/1.0

### Fetch a single post from JSONPlaceholder
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
Accept: application/json

### HEAD request (no response body expected)
HEAD https://httpbin.org/get

### OPTIONS request (inspect allowed methods in the response headers)
OPTIONS https://httpbin.org/get
